<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>CONVOY | Handmade Carpets</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 50% 30%,
        #173b65 0%,
        #0b213c 32%,
        #061426 62%,
        #040c17 100%);
      color: white;
    }

    header {
      padding: 32px 6%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .brand {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
    }

    .back {
      color: #ffffff;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      opacity: 0.75;
    }

    main {
      width: min(1100px, 88%);
      margin: 80px auto;
    }

    .kicker {
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 5px;
      opacity: 0.55;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(42px, 7vw, 90px);
      font-weight: 400;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .intro {
      max-width: 650px;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.8;
      opacity: 0.7;
      margin-bottom: 70px;
    }

    .services {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .service {
      min-height: 230px;
      padding: 32px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.025);
      transition: 0.3s ease;
    }

    .service:hover {
      transform: translateY(-5px);
      border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    }

    .number {
      font-size: 11px;
      opacity: 0.4;
      margin-bottom: 55px;
    }

    .service h2 {
      font-size: 18px;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      font-weight: 500;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .service p {
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      opacity: 0.6;
    }

    footer {
      width: min(1100px, 88%);
      margin: 100px auto 30px;
      padding-top: 25px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      opacity: 0.5;
    }

    @media (max-width: 800px) {
      .services {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      main {
        margin-top: 40px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <div class="brand">CONVOY</div>
  <a class="back" href="index.html">← HOME</a>
</header>

<main>

  <div class="kicker">CONVOY CARPETS</div>

  <h1>HANDMADE CARPETS</h1>

  <p class="intro">
    Traditional craftsmanship meets modern technology.
    Discover bespoke handmade carpets with a new approach
    to digital identity and authenticity.
  </p>

  <div class="services">

    <div class="service">
      <div class="number">01</div>
      <h2>CUSTOM MADE</h2>
      <p>
        Bespoke handmade carpets created to your preferred
        design, dimensions, colours and materials.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="service">
      <div class="number">02</div>
      <h2>DIGITAL & PRINTED CERTIFICATE</h2>
      <p>
  Each handmade carpet is accompanied by a digital and printed certificate documenting its identity, specifications and authenticity.
</p>    </div>

    <div class="service">
  <div class="number">03</div>
  <h2>HANDMADE & CUSTOM-MADE CARPETS</h2>
  <p>
    Bespoke carpets, individually designed and handwoven
    using traditional craftsmanship and fine materials.
  </p>
</div>
  </div>

</main>

<footer>
  CONVOY TECHNOLOGY LTD · LONDON · info@convoyCT.com
</footer>

</body>
</html>
